      "title" : "シーン 78",
      "duration" : 4.367687074829932,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "telop" : "「紫様…、あの射命丸文がこんな記事を先ほど投稿しまして…」",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #78",
      "characterName" : "蘭",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceDuration" : 3.767687074829932
    },
    {
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E8%98%AD",
      "id" : "600E9D0A-D370-43E3-942E-79A398FA9DDD",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_079_蘭.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "蘭",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.079.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 79",
      "duration" : 7.381632653061224,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "telop" : "蘭は、印刷されたネットニュース記事をそう言いながら渡す。\nそのニュース記事には、あの記者会見は嘘つきだと書かれていた。",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #79",
      "characterName" : "蘭",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceDuration" : 6.781632653061225
    },
    {
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E8%98%AD",
      "id" : "294B6C04-5679-4DF2-BC67-DA27FE4CB867",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_080_蘭.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "蘭",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.080.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 80",
      "duration" : 4.300544217687075,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "telop" : "「紫様…、これは文が紫様を裏切った…と言うことですか？」",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #80",
      "characterName" : "蘭",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceDuration" : 3.700544217687075
    },
    {
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB",
      "id" : "DA271853-0DA3-4BE3-8320-A0177497B3B9",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_081_八雲紫.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "八雲紫",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.081.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 81",
      "duration" : 7.582380952380952,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "telop" : "「ええ、そうなるわね。きっと私たちの見てない隙に、買収されたのよ…、巨漢党の置き土産である彼にね…」",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #81",
      "characterName" : "八雲紫",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceDuration" : 6.982380952380953
    },
    {
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB",
      "id" : "22C81D4B-3B0A-492A-8809-0933617E9A22",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_082_八雲紫.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "八雲紫",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92\/交換夫婦（26話目）_6500dcce92.082.jpeg",
      "title" : "シーン 82",
      "duration" : 7.871632653061224,
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "telop" : "「それと、彼のそばにいる霊夢の動きが見られない以上、彼女も彼に取られたことになるわ…、これは…私の失策よ…」",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #82",
      "characterName" : "八雲紫",
      "backgroundName" : "nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
      "voiceDuration" : 7.271632653061224
    },
    {
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E7%B4%AB",
      "id" : "B7DB0669-384A-4862-B2E4-12433AD642FD",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_083_八雲紫.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "八雲紫",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg",
